{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12155","headline":"送包何东游 · 钱起","name":"送包何东游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水国尝独往，送君还念兹。\n湖山远近色，昏旦烟霞时。\n子好谢公迹，常吟孤屿诗。\n果乘扁舟去，若与白鸥期。\n野趣及春好，客游欣此辞。\n入云投馆僻，采碧过帆迟。\n江上日回首，琴中劳别思。\n春鸿刷归翼，一寄杜蘅枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}